    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1374">

                <pb facs="0915" n="799" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg799"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.52/216.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Special Agent Carothers.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 8, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your April 8. The Red Cross will doubtless be able to extend some assistance to
                    destitute Spanish refugees from Torreon. Please ascertain if such assistance
                    will be acceptable to them, and the amount necessary for temporary relief.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
